WEBVTT

00:01:29.106 --> 00:01:31.782
na wimbi hili limekuwa la mafanikio sana

00:01:31.782 --> 00:01:33.720
na maarufu,

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:37.581
Kwa hiyo mwaka 1985, wapinzani wao wakatengeneza neno jipya

00:01:37.581 --> 00:01:39.145
Gaidi wa mazingira,

00:01:39.145 --> 00:01:41.269
Ili kubadilisha jinsi tunavyowaona.

00:01:41.269 --> 00:01:43.156
walitengeneza tuu.

00:01:43.156 --> 00:01:45.693
sasa kampuni hizi zimesaidia sheria mpya

00:01:45.693 --> 00:01:48.432
Kama Animal Enterprise Terrorism Act,

00:01:48.432 --> 00:01:50.551
ambayo inabadilisha uanaharakati kuwa ugaidi

00:01:50.551 --> 00:01:53.319
Kama itasababisha ukosefu wa faida.

00:01:53.319 --> 00:01:56.318
watu wengi hawajawahi hata kuisikia sheria hii,

00:01:56.318 --> 00:01:58.444
wakiwemo wabunge,

00:01:58.444 --> 00:02:00.355
Chini ya asilimia moja walikuwa bungeni